Rill @VERSION@ (Linux x86_64 native binary tarball)
===================================================

This archive contains the native Rill browser binary (`bin/search` and `bin/rill`
symlink) compiled against the system shared libraries listed in `BUILD_INFO.txt`.

Requirements
------------
- Linux x86_64 with glibc >= @GLIBC_FLOOR@
- GTK 3 (`libgtk-3.so.0`)
- WebKitGTK 4.1 >= 2.40 (`libwebkit2gtk-4.1.so.0`, `libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1.so.0`)
- libsoup 3 (`libsoup-3.0.so.0`)
- SQLite 3 (`libsqlite3.so.0`)
- GStreamer base & good plugins (required for WebAudio / `<audio>` playback)
  Optional: GStreamer libav/bad/ugly plugins for H.264/VP9 video

Quick install (per-user, no root required)
------------------------------------------
  ./install.sh
  ~/.local/bin/rill

System-wide install
-------------------
  sudo ./install.sh --prefix /usr/local

Uninstall
---------
  ./uninstall.sh
  # or: sudo ./uninstall.sh --prefix /usr/local

Uninstalling removes only installed program files and desktop metadata. Your
profile data (`~/.config/search`, `~/.local/share/search`, `~/.cache/search`)
is preserved.
